+# Isolated Eve-first home preview
+
+Run `./node_modules/.bin/vite --config tests/fixtures/eve-home-preview/vite.config.mjs` and open the reported loopback URL. This renders the real home, OS header and navigation with synthetic timeline and connection children; all application fetch calls are rejected. Verify the four Eve entry destinations and inspect desktop and narrow layouts. This is not production, a real account, a real timeline, Pixel hardware, an MCP connection, or an execution test. Stop the owned Vite server after use.
